{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre:</strong> Lane-Pushing Strategy / Autobattler (Adult)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon heroes to fight in <strong>autobattles</strong>, where units march forward and engage enemies automatically. Explore <strong>multiple worlds and maps</strong>, follow the <strong>story through dialogs</strong>, and earn <strong>evolution points</strong> to upgrade your heroes\u2019 abilities and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053560/extras/ccd02e6ddf71e17fdf2f05042de8e50e.poster.avif?t=1759704861\" width=520 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053560/extras/ccd02e6ddf71e17fdf2f05042de8e50e.webm?t=1759704861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053560/extras/ccd02e6ddf71e17fdf2f05042de8e50e.mp4?t=1759704861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through challenging battles to reach new stages and unlock <strong>exclusive adult-only rewards</strong>. The main campaign offers <strong>about 3 hours of gameplay</strong>, not including adult mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lane-pushing strategy with <strong>autobattles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon and manage heroes with different abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character upgrades and evolution points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple worlds and maps with increasing difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>adult-only rewards</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store